ent-MobSoldier = soldier
    .desc = A trained soldier on guard duty. Shoots intruders on sight, acts as a team and calls for backup.

ent-SpawnerMobSoldier = soldier spawner

ent-MobSoldierMedic = soldier medic
    .desc = The combat medic of a squad. Keeps behind the others, raises fallen comrades, drags the wounded out of the line of fire and bandages them.

ent-SpawnerMobSoldierMedic = soldier medic spawner

ent-MobSoldierHQ = soldier headquarters
    .desc = The headquarters of a squad. Keeps in the rear, takes in the reports of the soldiers over the radio and gives the orders: who checks a noise, where the hunters go, who suppresses and who goes around the enemy, where the posts are. If it is lost, one of the soldiers takes the command over.

ent-SpawnerMobSoldierHQ = soldier headquarters spawner

ent-SoldierSupplyAmmoCrate = ammunition supply crate
    .desc = A crate of ammunition for the soldiers: boxes of cartridges and grenades. It is restocked very slowly.

ent-SoldierSupplyMedicalCrate = medical supply crate
    .desc = A crate of medicines for the soldiers: bandages, ointment and gauze, and what the medic needs to fill its kits. It is restocked very slowly.

ent-SoldierRifleAmmoBox = ammunition box (.20 rifle)
    .suffix = soldier
    .desc = A cardboard box of .20 rifle rounds. It is quick to fill a magazine from.

ent-ClothingHeadsetSoldier = soldier headset
    .desc = A rugged military headset. It sends the voice straight to the common frequency.

ent-ClothingHeadsetSoldierNT = NT field headset
    .desc = A portable NT military radio with a security channel, independent of station telecomms.
ent-ClothingHeadsetSoldierNTHQ = NT field command headset
    .desc = A portable NT squad command radio with security and command encryption keys.
